~ start
Mentor: Every conductor has a fire in them. Most people use it for practical things — a healing touch, a little warmth. You're going to learn yours differently.
Mentor: Close your eyes. Feel the heat in your chest. Now push it out through your hand.
=> END

~ first_cast
Mentor: There it is. That's your fireball. Don't celebrate — do it again.
=> END

~ complete
Mentor: Ten times clean. You're not burning down the village. I'll call that a success.
Kael: When do I get to use it for real?
Mentor: Pray you never have to.
=> END
